<title>USA: U.S. cash ammonia prices fall sharply, DAP flat.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash ammonia prices fall sharply, DAP flat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash ammonia prices dropped sharply Monday in one of the season's first agricultural purchases, and diammonium phosphate (DAP) prices were flat, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>The difference between ammonia prices for the agricultural fertilizer and industrial markets is significant, dealers said.</p>
<p>			 Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  174-176		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    185-187		     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		197		     dn 23.00</p>
